{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-18_end","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-18","title":"列王行跡","storyCode":"14-20","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-18_end.txt","sourceHash":"30a4f68700001686fd3ee8754d5a31b067d3bdfa8cce32b6b8072f9290793c18","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"眾人踏上了通往通天巨塔之頂的道路，到達頂端時，天翻地轉。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"魔王以勒什死後，我又見了他很多面。\n他留在“魔王”中的情感與經歷，與我關於他的記憶有很大差異。\n我印象中的他，總是垂著頭坐在議事廳的中央，在王庭成員的吵鬧聲中不發一言。\n杜卡雷和孽茨雷認為他過於懦弱，當著他的面說黑王冠再一次選錯了繼承者。而他沒有反駁，只是看著窗外熔爐燃燒形成的濃煙出神。\n後來我才知道，以勒什是一名出色的術師和工匠，他也曾孜孜不倦地研究可以改善生活條件的法術，為卡茲戴爾如何邁進結晶時代規劃過許多可能。\n他在外遊歷多年，回到卡茲戴爾後，說服了死魂靈，準備在城市中心立起最大的熔爐。\n但隨著冠冕落在他的頭頂，新任的魔王變得越來越沉默。\n陡然承受過多的情感與回憶是無比痛苦的。許多被王冠選中的人都沒來得及留下姓名，就因陷入癲狂而死去。\n而以勒什沒有墜入瘋狂，他承受住了這一切。正因為他足夠清醒，才越來越絕望。\n黑冠向他，也向我揭露了一個事實——\n我們所構想的，屬於薩卡茲的未來，很有可能只是薩卡茲某段歷史的重複。\n一切建造的終將歸於毀滅。\n戰爭會撕碎他的卡茲戴爾。戰爭會殺死他。\n戰爭會殺死我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g2_mainbattlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1341_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他快不行了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上啊，拿下他，這巫術祭壇就廢了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"弩箭插進薩卡茲的胸膛。\n他並未在意，仍想繼續前進。\n“嘀嘀”“嘀嘀”。\n他低下頭，看到插在胸口的箭羽正在發亮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"集束彈藥在薩卡茲的血肉中爆裂。\n一次又一次密集的爆炸，再強大的巫術都無法如此迅速地修復創傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……成功了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，真的倒了，炸沒了，只剩下骨頭渣子了！這方法真的有效，我們果然不用怕這些怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等下——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲的殘骸在發光。\n士兵們不由得開始後退，但已經來不及了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"噴薄的火光和源石粉塵吞沒了戰場一角。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g3_mainbattlefield_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗長！您的身體……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不影響戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞人，攻勢猛烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們適應得很快……幾乎找到了對付我們的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的損傷正越來越大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的戰士，不會放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的防線，仍能堅持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經足夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信特雷西斯，與特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_1339_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至今……不變。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我曾很多次與特雷西斯聊起戈瀆，那位“砌城匠”。\n土石之子的氏族早已四散各地，我並不能像戈瀆一樣，號令石翼魔使用獨特的天賦，迅速地壘砌城牆。但我依然從他的堅韌性格與領導方式中獲益良多。\n織衣匠，砌城匠。\n我對特雷西斯開玩笑說，或許我和戈瀆真的很像。\n特雷西斯突然變得很嚴肅，他說，他不會讓我和戈瀆走上一樣的道路——死於最親近之人的背叛。\n我無法將戈瀆的所思所感完全分享給特雷西斯。\n但戈瀆臨終時的情感深深烙印於我的腦海。他最後一眼看見的，絕不是背叛他的炎魔，而是自己與無數同胞一手建起的城市。\n我們都知道，戈瀆不會是最後一位被至親至愛之人殺死的魔王，他的城市也一定不會是最後一座卡茲戴爾。\n只要仍然有人渴望回家，卡茲戴爾就一定會在灰燼中重生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g25_wildbattlefield_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"BM和TAA兩條路目前是暢通的，可以走！在接下來的十五分鐘裡，源石晶簇還不會長過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I9不行，費斯特，注意信標顏色變動。附近的源石山有崩塌風險。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"——可露希爾，我們在I903偵察點！有人受傷，看起來是平民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了看到了，有一輛小車在路上了。注意收貨，把防具和藥拿上，它知道接下來要去哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦對，還有兩架無人機也往你們的方向去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待會霧升起來之後，你看訊號燈的顏色，綠的就是前路沒問題。典範軍的人會在I901接應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我忍不住想……可露希爾，你這同時在操控多少雙手啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，也就七八……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，十幾雙吧。眼睛會更多一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼下的處境比絕大多數羅德島的天災救援任務都要複雜。芬……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"放心，不會掉以輕心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_1036_fang2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"可露希爾，你也要……滋滋滋……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……通訊干擾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"176和178號無人機失去訊號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……發現物資點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"藥，吃的，都有。沒什麼能用的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藥和食物可以給你一份。多的就不要拿了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你這赤手空拳的還能攔著……呃，血魔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，和王庭沒關係，我也不會那種一下子抽乾你們血的法術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，真要是那幫老混帳的人，我一下就射穿你的脖子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們並不是來執行任務的。曼弗雷德還不會派一隊連我們的標誌都不認識的人過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道說這些話可能對你們沒什麼用……但這個位置馬上就要炸開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能，不要影響我工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這要命的天災怎麼又要來了？王庭那幫老東西搓出來的到底是什麼東西啊，這鬼地方真是沒法待了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我是467號，你們人呢？我說——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"襲擊營地的雇傭兵均已解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，走吧。該轉移到下一個安全地點了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，謝啦，刺客大師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"投降嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"投降的話，你可以跟著我們一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……都被你們抓了，那我有什麼好選的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"這場仗打到現在，散落在戰場各處的雇傭兵會增多。除了聽從軍事委員會的指揮，他們還會幹回老本行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，類似的攻擊我們還會遭遇很多次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年……我們不也是這麼過來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"……是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是需要穿越天災，還是更多敵人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都會盡力讓更多想回家的人……回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍事委員會是不是又有新訊息了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說他們剛殺了一個維多利亞大公爵，馬上就會殺第二個第三個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……你那最近還有，呃，好用的藥嗎？我想治治這條傷腿，哪怕只是讓石頭稍微少一點，打起仗來跑得快一點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也要去倫蒂尼姆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆？我這哪趕得上，就算我想去，攝政王也不會要我啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這場仗……早晚會打到卡茲戴爾的吧？那群維多利亞人，萊塔尼亞人……他們哪裡會這麼輕易就放過我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲平民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，小個子，你也早做打算吧。再磨一磨你的兵器，回想下該怎麼殺人……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……軍事委員會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年了，我們的城市，真的又要……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼……哈……終於趕上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……你的同行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說信使啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，一晃這麼多年過去，我對卡茲戴爾都不太熟了。我聽說啊，我能在這個座標找到我要找的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能告訴我——去“巴別塔”舊址的路該怎麼走嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"巴別塔的事務進展和預期一樣阻礙重重。\n我從不擔憂失敗，但我最不想看見的，就是這些心懷希望的人，再度陷入絕望的循環。\n我在“魔王”中越潛越深。\n凱爾希提醒我，這可能會對我的身體造成負擔。但時間緊迫，我必須盡可能地調動所有資源。\n終於，我找到了“遠逐者”，薩卡茲的第一位魔王。\n我依稀看見一場席捲了天空與大地的戰爭，一群越來越絕望的人，還有……我無法確認那是否是源石。它的模樣和我們熟悉的黑色結晶差距很大，閃爍著一種潔淨的光澤。\n我們的魔王，最初的卡茲戴爾的守衛者，將自己的鮮血與靈魂獻給了它。\n之後，永夜降臨。聲與光在我們身上消失無蹤。\n“遠逐者”放棄了留下姓名，他甚至沒有在“魔王”中留下過多情感。我想他是有意的。他代所有薩卡茲擁抱了黑暗，便也將自己埋葬在黑暗裡。\n我所邁入的，是一座冷寂的墳墓。\n我在墓地裡徘徊，於無聲處反覆地思索。\n直到某一刻，我意識到，黑暗中並非空無一物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i19"},{"type":"narration","text":"一座塔。\n只要塔建得足夠高，就能抵達我們頭頂的黑暗。\n我們建起的一切固然都會崩塌毀滅，掩於流沙。\n但我們的意志，我們的渴求，會億萬次於塵埃中崛起。\n攀登。\n攀登。\n不斷地向上，越過我們的無知。\n直至，超越黑暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這就是為什麼……這裡會有一座塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼樣，我們看起來總算走到頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到底爬了多久？我覺得自己過了好幾輩子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，說不定……還要更長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子！你一直在發什麼呆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……死掉的老傢伙們連詞彙量都很匱乏的嘮叨？你還沒聽膩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭知道自己聽見的是誰的聲音。\n魔王就在眾魂之間。\n眾魂想讓魔王傾聽。\n阿米婭不由自主地想隨著這個聲音潛入“魔王”深處，在無數的時間與空間的碎片中摸索。\n戒指頂著她的掌心。\n只要解開它們……她就能讓從古至今的秘密，一切的來龍去脈湧入她的大腦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，不是現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"眾魂的意志在影響你，他們迫不及待地想讓你接受他們的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想理解……她的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你需要直面她。我們都需要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是的，阿米婭。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們一起。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"除了眾魂之外……博士、凱爾希醫生、W小姐的心聲都很清晰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一般敢用源石技藝窺探我的想法的人，下場都不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是……哈，我打賭我們這幾個走到這裡的人，想法都差不多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"急迫，緊張，又飽含著期待。\n和死寂的過往回聲截然不同的，是屬於此時此刻的鮮活情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一起上去吧，還差最後一點了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓我想想看，這層透明的天花板該怎麼拆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或許……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她已經告訴了我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"懸在他們頭頂的，黑暗中的眼睛。\n一個菱形。\n既像是黑暗中僅有的光源，又彷彿是吞噬了萬物光華的罪魁禍首——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g20_babeltop_ex3"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭抬起頭。\n眾魂之間的每一個魔王抬起頭。\n阿米婭向菱形伸出手去。\n眾魂之間的每一個魔王都伸出手去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g12_babeltop_ex"},{"type":"narration","text":"這是第一位魔王留給我的唯一的言語——\n“如黑夜般籠罩我們的石頭，它是我們的苦難，更是一種希望。”\n我們恰是為了希望而來。\n在這一刻，“遠逐者”“砌城匠”“青色怒火”……所有魔王都與我在一起。就連以勒什都再度拿起了他的法杖。\n他們與我一同戰鬥。\n為了同一個使命。\n魔王的使命。\n薩卡茲的未來，將在此揭曉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"天與地，上與下，光明與黑暗，未來與過去——\n都在瞬間倒轉。\n在塔頂也是塔底，終點也是原點，阿米婭聽到了一聲嘆息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們等到你了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……“魔王”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
